{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42278","headline":"送薛少卿赴青阳 · 徐铉","name":"送薛少卿赴青阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我爱陶靖节，吏隐从弦歌。\n我爱费徵君，高卧归九华。\n清风激颓波，来者无以加。\n我志两不遂，漂沦浩无涯。\n数奇时且乱，此图今愈赊。\n贤哉薛夫子，高举凌晨霞。\n安民即是道，投足皆爲家。\n功名与权位，悠悠何用夸。\n携朋出远郊，酌酒藉平沙。\n云收远天静，江阔片帆斜。\n离怀与企羡，南望长咨嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}